\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  For God so much loved the world  that
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He out of his great love
\par  gave His only begotten Son
\par  Oh! what great love is this
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  What was foreseen and wished for us
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 out of his compassion
\par So we could be saved right from now
\par  through all eternity.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   Our friend, and a good person too
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 who doth bless us always
\par He who is the Father's own son
\par  he has become human.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   My Saviour, I am happy too
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  you came as one of us,
\par I would like to be just like you
\par  in God's own glory there.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  The Son of Father Almighty
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0   Became my own Saviour;
\par     And also as the Prince of Peace
\par   To grant us salvation.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.   My ransome, light and life also
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  and joy, gladness as well
\par  my only thing and all I have
\par  l'll worship you always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Your poverty, was my plenty
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  you suffered for my sake
\par  My Lord, your humility too
\par  brought me respect also.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  Bless be the Father and the Son
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  and the Holy Spirit,
\par   You angels, give him all the praise
\par \pard       my spirit get involved.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

